    "e), or choose another name, as when the type changes; a nested block may shadow. Location: the secon"
    "d declaration.\n- `diag.duplicate-item` — Summary: this name is already declared in this module. Ph"
    "ase: static. Rule: `rule.module.resolve` `[Item-Duplicate]`. Invariant: none. Required: each qualifi"
    "ed name — `M::name` for a `fn`, `extern fn`, `struct`, `enum` or `module`, `M::T::name` for an ass"
    "ociated function, `M::E::V` for an enum variant — is added by at most one declaration; an `extern "
    "fn` with a body (an entry point, whose name is its C symbol) takes no name another entry point, the "
    "runtime (`cb_…`, `cobalt_…`), C or its library (a keyword, a standard header's macro, a C librar"
    "y or `libm` function, a name beginning with `_`) has (`spec/20` `[Extern-Entry]`). Observed: two, or"
